<article id="article-64" class="uk-article" data-permalink="https://www.westchesterlegislatorsny.gov/interactive-maps" typeof="Article" vocab="https://schema.org/">

    <meta property="name" content="Westchester County Legislative District Maps ">
    <meta property="author" typeof="Person" content="Administrator">
    <meta property="dateModified" content="2026-05-20T20:08:34-04:00">
    <meta property="datePublished" content="2010-02-25T17:31:46-05:00">
    <meta class="uk-margin-remove-adjacent" property="articleSection" content="General">

            
    
                        
                    <h1 property="headline" class="uk-margin-top uk-margin-remove-bottom uk-article-title">
                Westchester County Legislative District Maps             </h1>
        
        
        
        
        
                <div class="uk-margin-medium-top" property="text">

            
                            
<p class="HEADERORANGE"><br />Click any link below for the most current Westchester County Map.</p>
<p class="COPY" style="text-align: left;"><strong>The links below provide access to photographs, interactive maps and downloadable maps of the 17 districts:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li style="text-align: left;"><a href="/images/pdf/maps/2026/Legislative_Districts_Countywide.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">County Legislative District Map</a></li>
<li style="text-align: left;"><a href="https://giswww.westchestergov.com/wcgis/Mapping.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;"><span style="color: #810081;">Interactive Maps</span></a></li>
<li style="text-align: left;"><a href="https://planning.westchestergov.com/land-use-development/publications/maps-and-aerial-photos" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Maps and Aerial Photographs</a></li>
</ul>
<p style="text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;"><strong>Legislative District Maps*:</strong></span></p>
<p><b>*</b>The following legislative district maps conform to the District boundaries adopted by the Westchester County Board of Legislators via Local Law No. 18 – 2022, and amended via Local Law No. 12-2023.</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="/images/pdf/maps/2026/colegdist-1.pdf" target="_blank" title="Opens County Legislative District Map PDF in new window and leaves Westchester Legislators website">District 1</a></li>
<li><a href="/images/pdf/maps/2026/colegdist-2.pdf" target="_blank" title="Opens County Legislative District Map PDF in new window and leaves Westchester Legislators website">District 2</a></li>
<li><a href="/images/pdf/maps/2026/colegdist-3.pdf" target="_blank" title="Opens County Legislative District Map PDF in new window and leaves Westchester Legislators website">District 3</a></li>
<li><a href="/images/pdf/maps/2026/colegdist-4.pdf" target="_blank" title="Opens County Legislative District Map PDF in new window and leaves Westchester Legislators website">District 4</a></li>
<li><a href="/images/pdf/maps/2026/colegdist-5.pdf" target="_blank" title="Opens County Legislative District Map PDF in new window and leaves Westchester Legislators website">District 5</a></li>
<li><a href="/images/pdf/maps/2026/colegdist-6.pdf" target="_blank" title="Opens County Legislative District Map PDF in new window and leaves Westchester Legislators website">District 6</a></li>
<li><a href="/images/pdf/maps/2026/colegdist-7.pdf" target="_blank" title="Opens County Legislative District Map PDF in new window and leaves Westchester Legislators website">District 7</a></li>
<li><a href="/images/pdf/maps/2026/colegdist-8.pdf" target="_blank" title="Opens County Legislative District Map PDF in new window and leaves Westchester Legislators website">District 8</a></li>
<li><a href="/images/pdf/maps/2026/colegdist-9.pdf" target="_blank" title="Opens County Legislative District Map PDF in new window and leaves Westchester Legislators website">District 9</a></li>
<li><a href="/images/pdf/maps/2026/colegdist-10.pdf" target="_blank" title="Opens County Legislative District Map PDF in new window and leaves Westchester Legislators website">District 10</a></li>
<li><a href="/images/pdf/maps/2026/colegdist-11.pdf" target="_blank" title="Opens County Legislative District Map PDF in new window and leaves Westchester Legislators website">District 11</a></li>
